- C2: In scenario index 1 (Candidate), Aurora gross profit is 252709.87293377152 INR per week (call_0005 → 1.focal.gp.value).
- C3: In scenario index 3 (Cross-check), Aurora gross profit is 245605.88827842797 INR per week (call_0005 → 3.focal.gp.value).
- C4: In scenario index 4 (Downside input-cost stress), Aurora gross profit is 224539.98582598162 INR per week (call_0005 → 4.focal.gp.value).
- C5: In scenario index 1, Aurora weekly volume is 10442.375756758216 units (call_0005 → 1.focal.volume.value) versus 9384.991252258642 units in the baseline (call_0005 → 0.focal.volume.value).
- C6: In scenario index 1, Aurora 500ml PET gross profit is 85506.45375430181 INR per week (call_0005 → 1.gp.Aurora-pet_500ml.value) versus 77037.39562044071 INR in the baseline (call_0005 → 0.gp.Aurora-pet_500ml.value).
